==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~33.33 seconds<sup>120f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20~46.67 seconds<sup>600f~1,400f</sup>.
**8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
**8 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**8 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.

